[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23703.91, "timestamp": "06:35:03", "text": "等等。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23710.27, "timestamp": "06:35:10", "text": "去年3月31日，我第一次在YouTube上進行了直播。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23713.67, "timestamp": "06:35:13", "text": "，那天直播效果不錯。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23717.11, "timestamp": "06:35:17", "text": "直播了 2 個小時，但因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23720.07, "timestamp": "06:35:20", "text": "YouTube 的原因，嗯，我不得不把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23724.23, "timestamp": "06:35:24", "text": "它縮短到 11 小時 54 分鐘，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23727.07, "timestamp": "06:35:27", "text": "實際上是 11 小時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23729.67, "timestamp": "06:35:29", "text": "59 分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23732.948, "timestamp": "06:35:32", "text": "12 秒左右，我想是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23736.23, "timestamp": "06:35:36", "text": "但值得慶幸的是，YouTube 將其剪輯得非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23739.27, "timestamp": "06:35:39", "text": "短，就像他們把它刪除一樣，最終長度為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23743.468, "timestamp": "06:35:43", "text": "11 分鐘 11 小時 54 分鐘。"}]